==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldean Fates|Haunter|56}} from the {{TCG|Paldean Fates}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Haunter}}.
*'''Spin Turn''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Baltoy|60}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

